	"data": "Godot XR Handtracking Toolkit\n\nStripped-down hand pose toolkit from a real game.\nRepo: <https://github.com/RevolNoom/godot_xr_handtracking>\nLicense: Check repo\nGodot version: 4.x\nStatus: Extracted from a game project, minimal\n\nWhat It Provides\nHand pose detection modules\nGesture recognition patterns\nMinimal — no full framework, just the working parts from a shipped game\n\nRelevance\nAlternative to [[godot-xr-auto-hand]] if you need specific hand pose detection without the full auto-hand…",
